  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>c</mi></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi></math> </p><p>So, the common difference will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtext>rejected</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>Now, the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>M</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>c</mi></math> is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>33</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>"
